baseline small:   worker_cpu=97.92 ns/row  worker=106.61 ns/row  total=194.33 ns/row (5.15M rows/s)
baseline control: worker_cpu=44.60 ns/row  worker=37.87 ns/row   total=325.26 ns/row (3.07M rows/s)

